* Measurement of active, reactive, apparent power for 50/60Hz at starttime tx1
* change starttime tx1,
* change Ix(Plant1:U1) 2x
* change V(n006) 2x
*
.meas TRAN tx1 PARAM 6s
.meas TRAN tx2 PARAM tx1+20ms
*
.meas TRAN ti1 FIND time WHEN Ix(Plant1:U1)=0 TD=tx1 RISE=1
.meas TRAN tv1 FIND time WHEN v(n006)=0 TD=ti1 RISE=1
.meas TRAN Imax1 MAX Ix(Plant1:U1) FROM tx1 TO tx2 ; delta >=20ms
.meas TRAN Vmax1 MAX v(n006) FROM tx1 TO tx2
* for 60Hz instead of 5m choose 4.1667m
.meas TRAN Q1 PARAM 3*0.5*Imax1*Vmax1*sin((ti1-tv1)*90/5m)
.meas TRAN P1 PARAM 3*0.5*Imax1*Vmax1*cos((ti1-tv1)*90/5m)
.meas TRAN S1 PARAM 3*0.5*Imax1*Vmax1
.meas TRAN dt1 PARAM ti1-tv1


